  "title": "Oatmeal Banana Nut Bread",
  "description": "This is the best banana nut-oatmeal bread you can find with wonderful flavor. Double the recipe and share as gifts. Everyone will appreciate it.",
  "authors": [
    "kel7298"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:05:37-04:00",
